  "code" : "public int[] rearrangeArray(int[] nums) {\n    int n = nums.length;\n    int[] ans = new int[n];\n    int posIndex = 0, negIndex = 1;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        if (nums[i] > 0) {\n            ans[posIndex] = nums[i];\n            posIndex += 2;\n        } else {\n            ans[negIndex] = nums[i];\n            negIndex += 2;\n        }\n    }\n    return ans;\n}",
